OL,3,GNEWSAMan on the run after absconding
OL,4,Afrom prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who is currently on remand
OL,7,Fawaiting trial for blackmail and money
OL,8,Flaundering related offences is
OL,9,Funlawfully at large.
OL,11,FPatrick McDonagh, 37, absconded while
OL,12,Fon compassionate leave on 12 March 2026
OL,13,Fwhen he failed to return to HMP
OL,14,FMaghaberry.
OL,16,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,17,F(PSNI) said: "Despite extensive efforts
OL,18,Fto locate and arrest him, he has thus
OL,19,Ffar evaded police."
